umented exec stdin sentinel, write the prompt to stdin and close it, then preserve terminal usage parsing and configured provider timeout semantics; proves the managed adapter uses codex exec ... - rather than an undocumented implicit prompt path.\",\"id\":\"CHK-003:happy:1\",\"priority\":\"must\",\"type\":\"cli\"}]}},{\"context\":\"All provider-process launch sites must acquire the same bounded slot registry even when usage accounting is disabled. Preserve ledger fail-closed behavior, candidate-spec streaming/retention semantics, and explicitly classify remaining migrated/unmanaged execution surfaces.\",\"files\":{\"create\":[\"packages/main/src/core/provider-process-admission.ts\",\"packages/main/src/core/provider-process-registry.ts\"],\"modify\":[\"packages/main/src/core/autopilot-executor.ts\",\"packages/main/src/core/codex-review-leaf.ts\",\"packages/main/src/core/host-run.ts\",\"packages/main/src/core/lattice-dispatch.ts\",\"packages/main/src/handlers/candidate-spec-routing.ts\"],\"test\":[\"packages/main/src/tasks/candidate-spec-routing-smoke.ts\",\"packages/main/src/tasks/host-run-usage-smoke.ts\",\"packages/main/src/tasks/provider-process-registry-smoke.ts\"]},\"id\":\"CHK-004\",\"relatedDocs\":[\"docs/host-run-usage.md\",\"docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-llm-usage-ledger-execution-plan.md\",\"docs/requirements/decisions/multi-host-keyword-candidate-spec-routing-execution-plan.md\"],\"status\":\"done\",\"title\":\"Enforce shared provider admission independent of usage-ledger mode\",\"userSees\":\"Even with LATTICE_USAGE_LEDGER=0, a cross-provider spawn that would exceed the cap is rejected before spawn and lists the occupying runs; existing usage and candidate-routing output formats stay unchanged.\",\"verificationIntent\":{\"adversarial\":[{\"desc\":\"Enumerate production provider spawn call sites and prove each is either routed through the shared admission boundary or explicitly classified legacy_unmanaged with no gate claim; a new direct spawn path 